## Goal
Show how the treated (B1-B3) and untreated (A1-A3) samples separate on a principal component
analysis of the gene-level counts from the rnaseq_bulk run. The analysis only reports the
sample layout and variance explained; whether the separation is biologically meaningful is
left to the reader.

